#tr.ts: šinip šiqil kaspim
#tr.en: (For) the 120 grains of silver
2. sza# ri-isz-{d}marduk _ugula masz2-szu-gid2-gid2_ 
#tr.ts: ša rīš-marduk akil bārî
#tr.en: that to Rīš-marduk overseer of the diviners,
3. a#-na qa2-be2-e dingir-ha-bil 
#tr.ts: ana qabê ilu-ḫabil
#tr.en: with the guarantee of Ilu-ḫabil,
4. e-li ib-ni-{d}marduk# u3 i-lu-ni _dumu-mesz_ i-din-{d}la-ga-ma-al 
#tr.ts: eli ibni-marduk u iluni mārī i(d)din-lagamal
